#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information on IBM Quantum hardware and features of different processors"
msgstr "Maklumat tentang perkakasan IBM Quantum dan ciri-ciri pelbagai pemproses"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types"
msgstr "Jenis pemproses"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types {#processor-types}"
msgstr "Jenis pemproses {#processor-types}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types are named for the general technology qualities that go into builds, consisting of the family and revision. Family (for example, Heron) refers to the size and scale of circuits possible on the chip. This is primarily determined by the number of qubits and the connectivity graph. Revisions (for example, r3) are design variants within a given family, often leading to performance improvements or tradeoffs.\n"
msgstr "Jenis pemproses dinamakan berdasarkan kualiti teknologi umum yang digunakan dalam pembinaan, terdiri daripada keluarga dan semakan. Keluarga (contohnya, Heron) merujuk kepada saiz dan skala litar yang mungkin pada cip. Ini ditentukan terutamanya oleh bilangan qubit dan graf kesambungan. Semakan (contohnya, r3) adalah varian reka bentuk dalam sesuatu keluarga tertentu, yang sering membawa kepada peningkatan prestasi atau pertukaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Supported instruction set\">\n"
"To find the supported instruction set for a backend, use [this code](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates-ops). You can see all supported instructions in [this table](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Set arahan yang disokong\">\n"
"Untuk mencari set arahan yang disokong bagi sesebuah backend, gunakan [kod ini](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates-ops). Anda boleh lihat semua arahan yang disokong dalam [jadual ini](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As new processor families are added, older families are retired.  See the [Retired processor families](retired-qpus#families) section to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Apabila keluarga pemproses baru ditambah, keluarga lama akan ditamatkan. Lihat bahagian [Keluarga pemproses yang ditamatkan](retired-qpus#families) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nighthawk {#nighthawk}"
msgstr "Nighthawk {#nighthawk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Nighthawk processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/nighthawk.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Ikon pemproses Nighthawk](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/nighthawk.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With a grid topology, Nighthawk leverages our technology stack from Heron (couplers, signal delivery, and coherence) with increased connectivity for enhanced application workloads.\n"
msgstr "Dengan topologi grid, Nighthawk memanfaatkan tumpukan teknologi kami dari Heron (pengganding, penghantaran isyarat, dan koheran) dengan kesambungan yang lebih tinggi untuk meningkatkan beban kerja aplikasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View available Nighthawk processors](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Nighthawk)\n"
msgstr "[Lihat pemproses Nighthawk yang tersedia](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Nighthawk)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Revisions\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Semakan\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`r2` (September 2026) The second version of Nighthawk, with 120 programmable qubits and 458 physical qubits, including a high speed reset on each qubit which significantly increases the maximum number of circuits per second.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`r1` (December 2025) The first version of Nighthawk, with 120 qubits.\n"
msgstr "  `r1` (Disember 2025) Versi pertama Nighthawk, dengan 120 qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Heron {#heron}"
msgstr "Heron {#heron}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Heron processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/heron.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Ikon pemproses Heron](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/heron.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At 156 qubits, Heron is an Eagle-sized upgrade to Egret that pulls in substantial innovations in signal delivery that were previously deployed in Osprey. The signals required to enable the fast, high-fidelity two-qubit and single-qubit control are delivered with high-density flex cabling.\n"
msgstr "Dengan 156 qubit, Heron adalah naik taraf bersaiz Eagle kepada Egret yang memasukkan inovasi besar dalam penghantaran isyarat yang sebelumnya digunakan dalam Osprey. Isyarat yang diperlukan untuk membolehkan kawalan dua-qubit dan satu-qubit yang pantas dan berkesetiaan tinggi dihantar dengan kabel fleks berketumpatan tinggi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View available Heron processors](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Heron)\n"
msgstr "[Lihat pemproses Heron yang tersedia](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Heron)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Revisions\">\n"
"  `r3` (July 2025) Heron r3 is the result of targeted manufacturing improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Semakan\">\n"
"  `r3` (Julai 2025) Heron r3 adalah hasil penambahbaikan pembuatan yang disasarkan yang secara langsung memberi kesan kepada koheran, kesetiaan gate, dan prestasi bacaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `r2` (July 2024) This is a revision of the original Heron processor. The chip has been redesigned to include 156 qubits in a heavy-hexagonal lattice. While continuing to make use of the innovations of the original Heron processors, it also introduces a new TLS mitigation feature that controls the TLS environment of the chip, thereby improving coherence and stability across the whole chip.\n"
msgstr "  `r2` (Julai 2024) Ini adalah semakan pemproses Heron asal. Cip telah direka semula untuk merangkumi 156 qubit dalam kekisi heksagon berat. Sambil terus menggunakan inovasi pemproses Heron asal, ia juga memperkenalkan ciri mitigasi TLS baharu yang mengawal persekitaran TLS cip, sekali gus meningkatkan koheran dan kestabilan keseluruhan cip.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `r1` (December 2023) The first version of Heron with 133 qubits.\n"
msgstr "  `r1` (Disember 2023) Versi pertama Heron dengan 133 qubit.\n"
